                    "topic": "Strict Criteria",
                    "id": "node_6f352687",
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "topic": "① Primary colorectal tumor\nis totally resectable",
                        "id": "node_9da0bfbc",
                        "children": []
                      },
                      {
                        "topic": "② Metastasis is solitary,\nor multiple nodules confined\nto a single lobe/segment",
